stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DraftScope
    DraftScope --> PolicyCheck: user starts validation
    PolicyCheck --> Denied: out of scope
    PolicyCheck --> ApprovalRequired: sensitive action
    PolicyCheck --> Running: allowed green action
    ApprovalRequired --> Denied: rejected
    ApprovalRequired --> Running: approved
    Running --> Paused: user pause
    Paused --> Running: resume
    Running --> Stopped: kill switch
    Running --> Completed: budget complete
    Running --> Inconclusive: blocked or evidence insufficient
    Completed --> Reported
    Inconclusive --> Reported
    Denied --> [*]
    Reported --> Retest
    Retest --> PolicyCheck
